@startuml
left to right direction

title Use Case Diagram for AI-Powered Analysis & Insights System

rectangle "System" {
  usecase "CFR001: View Financial Insights Dashboard" as CFR001
  usecase "SAFR001: Manage Analysis Parameters" as SAFR001
  usecase "SFR020: Maintain Historical Record of Users' Insights" as SFR020
  usecase "AIFR009: Generate Client Predictive Intervention Recommendations" as AIFR009

  Client --> CFR001 : View financial data in a consolidated dashboard.
  
  SysAdmin --> SAFR001 : Manage analysis parameters for the AI system.

  FinancialAdvisor --> FAFR002 : View client intervention alerts when patterns require professional attention.
  FinancialAdvisor --> AIFR008 : Generate predictive intervention recommendations to proactively assist clients with financial issues.

  System --> SFR020 : Maintain a historical record of users' insights for trend analysis and effectiveness measurement.
  
  AISystem --> AIFR009 : Generate client predictive interventions based on detected patterns in user data.
}

@enduml